{"3869920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horizons of Achaea", "steam_appid": 3869920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chart the skies in this story-rich JRPG where the stars have vanished!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Horizons of Achaea</i></strong>, command your airship, recruit a crew of sky-farers, and uncover the mysteries behind a shattered world. Explore floating islands, battle foes in classic turn-based combat, and engage in tactical airship encounters as you restore what was lost — one constellation at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/155f02be99a5b7b5ba5f7edc1998e3ae.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Zei and Kaia Look at the Stars\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/155f02be99a5b7b5ba5f7edc1998e3ae.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by genre-defining classics like <i>Skies of Arcadia</i>, <i>Dragon Quest XI</i>, and <i>Tales of Symphonia</i>, <i>Horizons of Achaea</i> blends nostalgic design with modern storytelling and systems. Build your island home, upgrade your vessel, and form deep bonds with your crew — every journey you take shapes the future of Achaea!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/b764de10d0dfe55e40d94243a42b0c88.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Captain Valen&#039;s Airship Crew\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/b764de10d0dfe55e40d94243a42b0c88.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=1132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 <strong>Explore and Navigate by the Stars</strong> — chart a broken world where every new island is a discovery!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/9a3089cf56067e5d1bc5d13dc4570e3a.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Lira Comes Home\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/9a3089cf56067e5d1bc5d13dc4570e3a.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Turn-based ground combat</strong> — classic JRPG battles with modern pacing and character synergy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/a3ddeb909b73d334d127c29814ff1e44.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Zei versus Valen\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/a3ddeb909b73d334d127c29814ff1e44.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚢 <strong>Tactical airship battles</strong> — outmaneuver enemy vessels with timing, positioning, and skill!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/5bb2efd68a59b0281197b834a950d03c.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Enemy Encounters\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/5bb2efd68a59b0281197b834a950d03c.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 <strong>Build your home base</strong> — upgrade a floating island into your personal command center!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/3baa5e89ae3cc50880ee5179a63b900e.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Home Island\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/3baa5e89ae3cc50880ee5179a63b900e.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑‍✈️ <strong>Recruit and bond with your crew</strong> — assign characters to roles on your ship or in battle, each with unique stories and benefits!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/8cb6d6394c5ce811320e73a1c6c76352.avif?t=1767835158\" alt=\"Crew Aboard the Cormorant\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras_big/8cb6d6394c5ce811320e73a1c6c76352.avif?t=1767835158 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Orchestral soundtrack</strong> — composed by Tony Manfredonia (<i>The Outer Worlds 2</i>) and dynamically synced to your journey!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869920/extras/8a67fed91f5ba7442a5600bd5c6db088.avif?t=1767835158\" width=642 height=838 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chart the skies in this story-rich JRPG where the stars have